					"nextDialogs": [
						741360918
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲希里耶"
				},
				{
					"id": 741360918,
					"content": "好，废话结束。你，闭上嘴。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741360919
					],
					"speakerTitle": "肖西韦尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 741360919,
					"content": "你又是谁！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741360920
					],
					"speakerTitle": "纳克"
				},
				{
					"id": 741360920,
					"content": "罩着柔灯港这块的人的，你再多说一句，就要吃拳头了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						741360921
					],
					"speakerTitle": "肖西韦尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 741360921,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}，帮我捆上他，带上这什么心，我们该回去交差了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "肖西韦尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 741360912,
					"content": "之前忍得很辛苦吧，纳克先生。",
